          "notes": "This game contains themes and depictions that may not be suitable for all audiences. Players will encounter:\r\n\r\n-Psychological horror elements, including intense and unsettling scenarios.\r\n-Depictions of violence and references to death, presented in a pixel art style.\r\n-Disturbing dialogue and scenarios involving coercion, threats, and psychological manipulation.\r\n-Themes of self-harm, suicide, and sacrifice, presented as part of the narrative choices.\r\n-Mild references to alcohol usage in dialogue or environmental storytelling.\r\n-Please note that while these elements are integral to the storytelling and atmosphere, they are handled with care to serve the narrative and are not gratuitous. \r\n\r\nPlayers sensitive to these topics are advised to proceed with caution."
